#!name=J.A.R.V.I.S. AdBlock

#!desc=Lee's own ad-block module. Rule sources: AdGuard Base filter、AdGuard Chinese filter、AdGuard Mobile Ads filter、AdGuard DNS filter、EasyList、EasyList China、jiekouAD、AWAvenue Ads Rule、OISD Basic、hagezi DNS-Blocklists PRO mini、StevenBlack hosts、Pollock hosts、EasyPrivacy、neodevhost. Whitelist is enforced first (DIRECT), then the remote rule set.

